# Morningtide's Light: "Exile any number of target creatures. At the beginning of the next end step, return those cards to the battlefield tapped under
# their owners' control." Bot1 exiles its own untapped Ornithopter and Bot2's untapped Llanowar Elves in its second main phase; both are gone until
# the end step (CR 603.7), where each comes back tapped (CR 110.2a) under its owner. The Light itself was exiled as its last instruction, not put into
# the graveyard.

